commit c35a73bbb3b4a667ed887113701d730862abd35e
Author: Greg Rundlett <greg.rundlett@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 25 02:37:40 2025 +0000

    Add comments to CommentStreams config
    
    Meza specifically sets
          $wgCommentStreamsAllowedNamespaces = -1;
    so you MUST use <comment-streams /> in the page content to enable it
    on a per page basis.
    
    If left to the default (null), comment-streams is allowed on all
